Compiler ki Nazar me: Jab C# compiler isko dekhta hai, toh wo samajh jata hai ki ye dono alag files nahi, balki ek hi class ke do hisse hain, aur wo inhein jod kar ek poori class bana deta hai! Tum chahe new User() karke Id, Name aur Login() teeno ko ek sath access kar sakte ho.

Interview ke Rules (Yeh yaad rakhna):
Keyword mandatory: Har ek file me partial keyword likhna zaroori hai (jaise public partial class User).

Ek hi Namespace: Saare partial tukde same namespace ke andar hone chahiye.

Access Modifiers match hone chahiye: Agar ek file me public hai, toh baaki me bhi public hi hona chahiye.
